  "finding": "Both Micropia pavilion hip roofs have upward winding in the exact isolated draft and current builder. Current ARTIS gate builder first roof (positive X) has six downward faces; its installed compressed GLB has four valid downward sloped faces after near-square ridge collapse. Negative X kiosk has six upward faces. Axis exchange when d>w reflects orientation, masking the helper defect in Micropia.",
